235 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 45 0 R
/T (role-based access control mechanism in Zoho Creator. Structured registration with typed fields replaces unstructured sign-ups \(spreadsheets, chat messages and free-text emails\) with clean, consistent and analysable data. The three-level hierarchy and the directional Read Only share rule keep information channels isolated: Track Managers see only what they need and cannot alter master records, while the CEO and Organizing Committee Head retain oversight. The result is a secure, auditable and scalable event-management framework.)
/E (role-based access control mechanism in Zoho Creator. Structured registration with typed fields replaces unstructured sign-ups \(spreadsheets, chat messages and free-text emails\) with clean, consistent and analysable data. The three-level hierarchy and the directional Read Only share rule keep information channels isolated: Track Managers see only what they need and cannot alter master records, while the CEO and Organizing Committee Head retain oversight. The result is a secure, auditable and scalable event-management framework.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
